# Abliteration Bulk Creator — proxy list.
#
# One proxy per line. Blank lines and lines starting with `#` are ignored.
# Supported formats (scheme defaults to http; override with ABC_PROXY_SCHEME):
#
#   host:port
#   host:port:user:pass
#   user:pass@host:port
#   http://user:pass@host:port
#   socks5://user:pass@host:port
#
# Examples (replace with your own residential/mobile proxies):

# --- host:port:user:pass (very common) ---
# 31.59.20.176:6754:myuser:mypassword
# 45.38.107.97:6014:myuser:mypassword

# --- user:pass@host:port ---
# myuser:mypassword@31.59.20.176:6754

# --- scheme + credentials ---
# socks5://myuser:mypassword@31.59.20.176:6754

# --- plain host:port ---
# 31.59.20.176:6754
